      <description>&lt;p&gt;Been testing iPhone Duo simulator and added on-the-fly response to fold/unfold/rotation events on the various layouts. Instead of scaling the game, I increased the visible area when unfolded which works out like an iPad version. I like it. Will have to be one of those &amp;quot;I only tested on the simulator though&amp;quot; updates.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
